.git
.idea
.vscode
.agents
.claude
**/AGENTS.md
**/CLAUDE.md

**/node_modules
**/dist
**/bin
**/obj
**/TestResults
**/artifacts
# Include source recipes and inventories, excluding generated browser files.
!artifacts
artifacts/recipes/*/out
web/public/audio/rnnoise.wasm
web/public/audio/gtcrn-worklet.js
web/public/audio/gtcrn.wasm
web/public/audio/speex.wasm
web/public/codecs
web/public/bergamot-models/*
web/public/audio/*-worklet.js
artifacts/files
media/target
init/target
api/target
# **/bin is not Rust output, but src/bin holds extra binaries of a Rust crate.
!media/src/bin
# The API's tests, examples and their fixtures are not part of the image's
# build, and a change to one would otherwise rebuild the API's stage.
api/crates/*/tests
api/crates/*/examples
# The browser smoke harness of the media server runs on a developer's machine;
# in the context it would only invalidate the cached media build.
media/smoke

# The project site has its own build and is not part of the image.
website
# Neither is the installer, which runs on the host before there is an image.
init/installer
# Neither are the native apps.
client

# Instance data and credentials never belong in an image.
data
**/secrets
# The API's secrets module is source, not a folder of secrets.
!api/crates/server/src/secrets
**/certs
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.local
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks

# Installer transaction files can contain the operator's .env.
.stellarr-install-stage*
